  "description": "Costco Wholesale Corporation 2017 Annual Report (fiscal year ended 3 September 2017), which reproduces the Form 10-K text. The label templates are illustrative; only fields the document states are asserted.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "cited",
    "citation": "\"We report on a 52/53-week fiscal year, consisting of thirteen, four-week periods and ending on the Sunday nearest the end of August. The first three quarters consist of three periods each, and the fourth quarter consists of four periods (five weeks in the thirteenth period in a 53-week year).\" \"References to 2017 relate to the 53-week fiscal year ended September 3, 2017. References to 2016 and 2015 relate to the 52-week fiscal years ended August 28, 2016, and August 30, 2015, respectively.\" (Business Overview, p. 6) \"The Company operates on a 52/53 week fiscal year basis with the fiscal year ending on the Sunday closest to August 31.\" (Note 1, p. 44) Note 12, Quarterly Financial Data (pp. 65 and 66): \"53 Weeks Ended September 3, 2017\" with quarters of 12, 12, 12 and 17 weeks; \"52 Weeks Ended August 28, 2016\" with quarters of 12, 12, 12 and 16 weeks. Establishes the year-end rule, end-year naming, thirteen four-week periods in quarters of 3, 3, 3 and 4 periods, the extra week as the thirteenth period's fifth week, the three fiscal year ends and week counts, and the quarter week counts.",
    "url": "https://s201.q4cdn.com/287523651/files/doc_financials/2017/ar/2017-Annual-Report-Final-(2).pdf",
